WEBVTT

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:15.950
Hey, there!

00:00:20.630 --> 00:00:22.540
I have some nice pics.

00:00:24.790 --> 00:00:26.670
Photos of Rare Iguras!

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:29.020
See any you like?

00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:30.440
Oh, uh, yeah.

00:00:31.050 --> 00:00:34.130
I'll take this one, this one, and this one.

00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:36.430
Couldn't make up your mind?

00:00:36.430 --> 00:00:39.390
What? No, these are for investigation!

00:00:39.710 --> 00:00:40.660
Investigation?

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:42.860
Nothing!

00:00:42.860 --> 00:00:44.040
How much do I owe you?

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:45.400
I don't want any money.

00:00:46.150 --> 00:00:47.310
Instead...

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.320
Let me take a few shots.

00:00:51.320 --> 00:00:52.780
You shouldn't...

00:00:52.780 --> 00:00:54.400
Oh, I insist.

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:56.120
You're shockingly popular.

00:00:56.120 --> 00:00:58.740
You're the mysterious transfer student!

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:01.340
Get him eating the hot dog!

00:01:01.340 --> 00:01:02.640
That's a good idea!

00:01:02.640 --> 00:01:03.910
Do it!

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:06.830
Here, eat!

00:01:06.830 --> 00:01:08.560
Say, "Ah!"

00:01:08.560 --> 00:01:09.820
Quit it!

00:01:14.330 --> 00:01:17.680
<i>Jin's making really good progress.</i>

00:01:17.680 --> 00:01:19.010
<i>Good for him.</i>

00:02:53.030 --> 00:02:54.520
Are you serious?

00:02:54.520 --> 00:02:57.030
You didn't get to tell her?

00:02:57.790 --> 00:02:58.600
No...

00:02:59.730 --> 00:03:01.700
All right, all right.

00:03:02.070 --> 00:03:07.420
Your bro Andy is going to give you a
boost, or should I say, dig you a hole?

00:03:07.420 --> 00:03:09.290
You don't have to dig a hole for everything.

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:13.100
Everyone's way too serious at Neo-Deava, anyway.

00:03:13.100 --> 00:03:16.780
What we need is something exciting!

00:03:16.780 --> 00:03:18.820
Something to get everyone to have fun!

00:03:18.820 --> 00:03:22.420
How are you going to excite anyone by digging a hole?

00:03:22.420 --> 00:03:23.930
Dude, I got this.

00:03:24.790 --> 00:03:27.220
You know what day tomorrow is, right?

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:30.890
Tomorrow is the anniversary of Holy Angel Academy's founding.

00:03:31.570 --> 00:03:34.380
On that day 12 years ago,

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:37.200
the school was founded to gather young Elements,

00:03:37.200 --> 00:03:40.650
and prepare them to defend Earth from its attackers.

00:03:41.970 --> 00:03:49.860
I expect that each of you will live up to your predecessors

00:03:50.550 --> 00:03:56.740
and redouble your work and studies for the future.

00:03:56.740 --> 00:04:00.400
<i>Tomorrow is the anniversary of our school's founding.</i>

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:03.010
<i>Let's forget about the daily grind and plan our own awesome event!</i>

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:07.740
<i>We'll have a planning meeting after school in the boys' dorm.</i>

00:04:07.740 --> 00:04:08.930
What is this?

00:04:10.370 --> 00:04:12.160
Andy wouldn't let it go.

00:04:12.160 --> 00:04:13.730
Hey, what's going on?

00:04:14.410 --> 00:04:15.650
You can come, too, Zessica.

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:20.580
Why did you invite Zessica?

00:04:20.580 --> 00:04:21.860
What are you talking about?

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:22.650
Nothing!

00:04:33.890 --> 00:04:36.540
Hey, Jin. Give me a hand.

00:04:37.910 --> 00:04:40.060
Wait! Hold on a sec!

00:04:40.060 --> 00:04:41.000
What?

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:42.300
You can't go to sleep now!

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:46.140
The girls are coming over, and we're going to have a sweet pajama party!

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:48.800
Yes, a pajama party!

00:04:48.800 --> 00:04:53.560
A form of excitement enjoyed 12,000 years ago!

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:55.560
Wasn't it supposed to be a planning meeting?

00:04:55.560 --> 00:04:57.700
Come on, help me out!

00:04:57.700 --> 00:04:59.820
You're not great with girls, are you?

00:04:59.820 --> 00:05:01.400
This is a good opportunity!

00:05:01.970 --> 00:05:05.400
Better learn now, before you have to Unite with one!

00:05:06.010 --> 00:05:07.120
Unite?

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:08.410
Hell yeah, Union!

00:05:09.110 --> 00:05:13.620
When our hearts join, and we caress with our souls!

00:05:13.620 --> 00:05:16.460
And at that instant, pure bliss!

00:05:17.210 --> 00:05:18.710
It really feels that good?

00:05:18.710 --> 00:05:21.610
It's a feeling that can't be put into words.

00:05:21.610 --> 00:05:25.090
But you'll understand when you do it yourself!

00:05:25.490 --> 00:05:28.430
You know, you still haven't done it with a girl...

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:31.160
Union...

00:05:40.410 --> 00:05:42.560
Since when was this hole here?

00:05:48.950 --> 00:05:50.060
Are you okay?

00:05:50.060 --> 00:05:53.640
I'm fine! I'm not scared at—!

00:05:57.450 --> 00:05:59.750
I'm really sorry for scaring you.

00:06:00.490 --> 00:06:01.750
Yunoha?

00:06:03.370 --> 00:06:05.760
Could I please come with you?

00:06:11.270 --> 00:06:13.080
What troubles you, my friend?

00:06:14.150 --> 00:06:15.270
Shrade.

00:06:15.270 --> 00:06:18.160
It must be something for you to be so lost in thought.

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:20.780
Are you still concerned about that transfer student?

00:06:23.110 --> 00:06:28.080
He appears to bear darkness in his heart.

00:06:28.080 --> 00:06:31.280
Much like yourself.

00:06:33.410 --> 00:06:35.440
You don't know anything about me!

00:06:37.750 --> 00:06:39.620
Finally, we're through!

00:06:40.410 --> 00:06:41.250
Mikono!

00:06:45.370 --> 00:06:46.880
Here we are!

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:49.720
Welcome to the forbidden mens' dorms!

00:06:49.720 --> 00:06:53.430
Don't be shy! Come in and make yourselves at...

00:06:57.450 --> 00:06:58.810
Hey, what are you guys doing here?

00:06:58.810 --> 00:07:01.270
He just ran into us...

00:07:01.270 --> 00:07:03.190
Seriously?

00:07:03.190 --> 00:07:04.860
We're crashing this party.

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:05.800
Excuse us.

00:07:06.310 --> 00:07:10.420
We're not trying to do anything weird here!

00:07:10.420 --> 00:07:13.960
We just want to plan something exciting for the anniversary...

00:07:13.960 --> 00:07:15.330
Did you say "exciting?"

00:07:16.190 --> 00:07:20.210
Wait! He didn't mean it like love! Exciting!

00:07:20.210 --> 00:07:22.710
We just want to have a really fun party, and...

00:07:23.130 --> 00:07:25.960
Cut that out! Stop nosing around in our stuff!

00:07:25.960 --> 00:07:32.320
But Mix said boys hide all their tainted stuff.

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:39.380
I've never been in a boy's room before, so I want to see if that's true.

00:07:39.380 --> 00:07:41.400
Well, stop it!

00:07:45.350 --> 00:07:46.180
Hi.

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:50.280
I found a tainted picture!

00:07:50.280 --> 00:07:51.360
That's not—

00:07:53.550 --> 00:07:54.740
Silvie?

00:07:55.780 --> 00:07:57.740
It's that actress!

00:07:57.740 --> 00:08:00.320
She was the female lead in <i>Skies of Aquaria</i>.

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:03.200
I'm kind of a fan of hers.

00:08:03.200 --> 00:08:05.880
But this doesn't look like a publicity photo.

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:09.210
Jin's a fan of hers too. Aren't you?

00:08:10.610 --> 00:08:11.720
Really?

00:08:12.190 --> 00:08:14.740
Why don't you show them?

00:08:15.330 --> 00:08:18.380
You know, that device that plays Alicia's song.

00:08:18.890 --> 00:08:19.840
Whoa!

00:08:19.840 --> 00:08:21.730
Can we see?

00:08:29.730 --> 00:08:31.050
Wow!

00:08:31.050 --> 00:08:32.680
Sweet!

00:08:32.680 --> 00:08:34.120
Where did you get that?

00:08:35.740 --> 00:08:37.840
Hey, I know!

00:08:37.840 --> 00:08:38.900
What?

00:08:38.900 --> 00:08:40.500
The anniversary party event!

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:43.300
Let's show <i>Skies of Aquaria</i>!

00:08:43.300 --> 00:08:45.000
I think that would be great!

00:08:45.470 --> 00:08:46.260
Right?

00:08:53.730 --> 00:08:57.140
Tonight, the Berlin itself will become a giant movie screen!

00:08:57.140 --> 00:09:00.640
There'll be an emergency screening of <i>Skies of Aquaria</i>!

00:09:00.640 --> 00:09:04.890
The movie will begin at 12 sharp in the courtyard under the Berlin!

00:09:05.430 --> 00:09:07.900
It will be opened with a live performance by Shrade!

00:09:08.760 --> 00:09:11.150
You're showing a movie on the Berlin?

00:09:11.570 --> 00:09:13.530
I take it you have permission.

00:09:13.530 --> 00:09:17.320
Of course I do! It's the big anniversary event!

00:09:17.320 --> 00:09:18.530
Come and have some fun!

00:09:19.150 --> 00:09:21.580
You can join the crowd and go wild,

00:09:22.150 --> 00:09:24.370
watch it quietly by yourself,

00:09:24.770 --> 00:09:27.680
or make it a special, romantic night for two!

00:09:27.680 --> 00:09:29.170
Hey, wanna watch with me?

00:09:29.170 --> 00:09:31.050
With you? Never!

00:09:31.710 --> 00:09:37.080
Is this wise? We never know when the Abductors will attack.

00:09:37.080 --> 00:09:39.970
But we must also relax from time to time.

00:09:41.410 --> 00:09:43.660
Life is but a dream.

00:09:43.660 --> 00:09:48.860
A dream recorded on film is yet a dream.

00:09:50.230 --> 00:09:52.150
Come in, command!

00:09:52.830 --> 00:09:53.680
This is Jin!

00:09:53.680 --> 00:09:55.460
What's going on? Is anyone there?

00:09:56.110 --> 00:09:58.780
What's happening up there?

00:09:59.190 --> 00:10:01.620
This is a top priority message.

00:10:01.620 --> 00:10:05.220
I've identified a Rare Igura who could be the true Eve.

00:10:05.220 --> 00:10:07.720
I'm going to bring her back in one of the Machine Angel's components.

00:10:07.720 --> 00:10:09.460
Be ready to open the gate.

00:10:10.010 --> 00:10:11.170
Jin?

00:10:15.870 --> 00:10:18.600
Did you hear that?

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:21.720
Did you hear?

00:10:22.570 --> 00:10:25.260
I didn't...

00:10:25.260 --> 00:10:27.200
What's the matter, Yunoha?

00:10:27.200 --> 00:10:28.810
Come here and give me a hand.

00:10:32.850 --> 00:10:33.570
Wait!

00:10:46.430 --> 00:10:47.660
No!

00:10:56.850 --> 00:10:58.380
She'll never forgive me...

00:11:00.830 --> 00:11:04.040
And if you get pineapple on it, it's even better!

00:11:04.040 --> 00:11:07.430
No way! I can't stand pineapple on pizza!

00:11:08.410 --> 00:11:11.300
Zessica! Come check this out!

00:11:11.300 --> 00:11:13.810
We're gonna get a pizza delivered!

00:11:14.130 --> 00:11:16.110
Sounds great.

00:11:16.110 --> 00:11:18.040
But I'm kind of busy.

00:11:20.530 --> 00:11:25.200
If I hadn't been in that theater that day watching <i>Skies of Aquaria</i>,

00:11:26.130 --> 00:11:28.450
we never would have met.

00:11:29.950 --> 00:11:31.080
Yeah.

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:35.080
And we wouldn't be here doing this either.

00:11:37.170 --> 00:11:38.040
I'm sorry.

00:11:39.570 --> 00:11:40.930
What for?

00:11:41.410 --> 00:11:45.660
For getting you into all this danger.

00:11:45.660 --> 00:11:47.400
It's not your fault!

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:51.520
All of this is my choice.

00:11:52.710 --> 00:11:54.900
Alicia said it in the movie.

00:11:57.030 --> 00:12:01.300
Everyone has the wings to fly beyond their destiny.

00:12:11.390 --> 00:12:15.790
My mom flew away beyond her destiny.

00:12:18.630 --> 00:12:23.130
She abandoned me when I was little.

00:12:25.010 --> 00:12:28.760
And my mom... is Alicia.

00:12:30.870 --> 00:12:33.040
So that's why you have that picture.

00:12:34.110 --> 00:12:37.320
She flew off beyond her destiny,

00:12:38.150 --> 00:12:41.200
went away, and left me behind here.

00:12:42.910 --> 00:12:46.200
All I could do was watch her.

00:12:48.220 --> 00:12:52.830
Mom never wanted me.

00:12:54.170 --> 00:12:55.330
You're wrong!

00:12:56.830 --> 00:12:58.860
I was like you!

00:12:58.860 --> 00:13:00.740
Cayenne did everything, and...

00:13:01.500 --> 00:13:03.970
and I was useless.

00:13:04.970 --> 00:13:09.850
The Suzushiro family is supposed to have great Element powers.

00:13:09.850 --> 00:13:13.730
But I didn't have any, and he left me behind.

00:13:15.390 --> 00:13:17.770
When he got into Neo-Deava...

00:13:22.850 --> 00:13:27.950
But just because we're useless doesn't mean that no one wants us!

00:13:28.770 --> 00:13:31.230
Everyone is wanted by someone.

00:13:31.230 --> 00:13:34.400
Everyone has someone somewhere who wants them,

00:13:34.970 --> 00:13:36.460
who's waiting for them.

00:13:39.510 --> 00:13:43.020
You made me realize that, Amata.

00:13:43.850 --> 00:13:44.970
I...

00:13:47.450 --> 00:13:48.520
Thank you.

00:13:50.470 --> 00:13:53.970
Will you watch the movie with me?

00:13:55.870 --> 00:13:58.920
I'll find a special spot where no one will bother us.

00:13:59.630 --> 00:14:01.650
A special spot? How?

00:14:04.010 --> 00:14:08.360
With... with my wings for flying beyond destiny.

00:14:18.650 --> 00:14:20.790
That's no way to watch a movie.

00:14:21.230 --> 00:14:23.300
Let's just keep our feet on the ground, okay?

00:14:25.950 --> 00:14:27.700
Don't grab me there!

00:14:27.700 --> 00:14:29.930
Now's not the time for that!

00:14:31.870 --> 00:14:32.980
Mikono!

00:14:50.350 --> 00:14:53.280
I have to tell her I'm sorry.

00:14:54.510 --> 00:14:58.560
Otherwise, she'll have her guard up, and I'll never be able to take her back.

00:15:17.610 --> 00:15:21.300
I think it turned out very interestingly.

00:15:24.020 --> 00:15:28.030
How do you intend to take responsibility for this?

00:15:28.470 --> 00:15:29.780
"Responsibility"?

00:15:30.630 --> 00:15:35.220
Are you saying that I understand such a concept?

00:15:35.220 --> 00:15:36.480
You...

00:15:36.480 --> 00:15:38.380
But forget that for now.

00:15:38.380 --> 00:15:41.540
Something fascinating is happening to Jin.

00:15:42.330 --> 00:15:46.800
He has begun his journey into the realm of love.

00:15:47.570 --> 00:15:48.550
What?

00:15:49.270 --> 00:15:52.680
Love is the root of sin.

00:16:00.190 --> 00:16:01.860
About before, I just...

00:16:02.890 --> 00:16:03.730
I'm sorry.

00:16:04.430 --> 00:16:06.000
It's all right.

00:16:06.000 --> 00:16:09.360
I was shocked at the time, but it's fine now.

00:16:09.670 --> 00:16:15.040
Everyone has secrets they really have to keep.

00:16:15.040 --> 00:16:16.830
That's...

00:16:16.830 --> 00:16:18.420
But you have to believe me!

00:16:19.120 --> 00:16:21.830
I really didn't hear anything!

00:16:26.510 --> 00:16:27.810
Jin?

00:16:27.810 --> 00:16:29.360
It's nothing!

00:16:31.950 --> 00:16:34.390
You fixed Tama for me!

00:16:34.390 --> 00:16:35.460
Tama?

00:16:35.460 --> 00:16:36.860
That's her name.

00:16:37.890 --> 00:16:38.900
Oh.

00:16:40.190 --> 00:16:41.360
Thank you.

00:16:41.910 --> 00:16:42.760
Don't mention it.

00:16:43.990 --> 00:16:45.260
I know!

00:16:45.260 --> 00:16:49.980
Let's watch <i>Skies of Aquaria</i> together like friends again!

00:16:51.510 --> 00:16:54.820
I've never even seen it before.

00:16:55.790 --> 00:16:58.280
I'm really looking forward to it.

00:16:59.930 --> 00:17:00.990
Okay.

00:17:02.090 --> 00:17:03.410
It's a promise!

00:17:05.390 --> 00:17:06.580
Bye!

00:17:06.580 --> 00:17:07.420
Wait!

00:17:14.430 --> 00:17:16.460
I'll be waiting right here tonight!

00:17:25.240 --> 00:17:26.340
Is this...

00:17:27.050 --> 00:17:28.190
Could it be...

00:17:29.430 --> 00:17:30.660
Union?

00:17:57.030 --> 00:17:58.720
I thought I left it right here.

00:18:01.610 --> 00:18:02.880
Oh, well.

00:18:17.490 --> 00:18:18.540
It's pretty...

00:18:25.970 --> 00:18:27.160
Jin?

00:18:28.330 --> 00:18:29.420
Are you there?

00:18:37.390 --> 00:18:38.800
Jin, are you there?

00:18:40.230 --> 00:18:42.040
Kagura is on his way.

00:18:42.730 --> 00:18:45.060
The gate to Vega will open soon.

00:18:46.170 --> 00:18:51.020
Bring your Rare Igura before he destroys everything.

00:18:59.430 --> 00:19:00.440
Sorry I'm late.

00:19:03.870 --> 00:19:04.660
What's the matter?

00:19:12.370 --> 00:19:13.920
It's nothing.

00:19:35.150 --> 00:19:37.150
Cheers!

00:19:53.770 --> 00:19:56.670
Ladies and gentlemen, your feature presentation!

00:19:56.670 --> 00:20:00.050
A masterpiece for the ages, <i>Skies of Aquaria</i>!

00:20:00.630 --> 00:20:03.960
Sit back, relax, and enjoy!

00:20:12.030 --> 00:20:15.560
A story of a meeting and a parting.

00:20:15.560 --> 00:20:18.320
A story of a miracle.

00:20:19.470 --> 00:20:27.080
A story of the promise we made 12,000 years ago beneath the tree of life.

00:20:27.080 --> 00:20:28.700
A story of love.

00:20:38.210 --> 00:20:43.090
Everyone has the wings to fly beyond their destiny.

00:21:31.870 --> 00:21:34.520
<i>Abductor alert! Abductor alert!</i>

00:21:36.270 --> 00:21:37.160
Seriously?

00:21:37.160 --> 00:21:39.520
We're being attacked <i>now</i>?!

00:21:46.030 --> 00:21:47.080
Kagura!

00:21:52.820 --> 00:21:54.080
It's him!

00:22:02.150 --> 00:22:03.140
Are you okay?

00:22:13.030 --> 00:22:17.060
Where's my wench?

00:22:26.370 --> 00:22:27.580
Yunoha Thrul.

00:22:29.150 --> 00:22:31.320
Come with me.

00:24:10.950 --> 00:24:14.160
When the boys feel <i>halta di mana</i>,

00:24:14.160 --> 00:24:17.310
the girl will learn <i>cinca di mana</i> for the first time.

00:24:17.630 --> 00:24:20.770
But the two of them will <i>ola ola o</i>.

00:24:21.430 --> 00:24:25.020
Next time on Aquarion Evol: The Fallen Giant.
